# Proyecto Oráculo

The oracle is a black box. Students call `evaluar`. Do not document or expose `_generar`, `_verificar`, or the cache format in the notebook.

Students may call `evaluar` and `validar` as many times as they want. Never add counters, budgets or any accounting of consultations. `r.trazas` comes with every result.

Keep the student path to four lines before their cell:

```
modelo = cargar_modelo("pequeno")
datos = cargar_datos()
busqueda, validacion = dividir(datos)
oraculo = Oraculo(modelo, busqueda, validacion)
```

`ayudas.py` is readable. `oraculo.py` is consulted, not opened. Do not add a web app or extra frameworks.
